{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t2004年起上演的「幻彩詠香江」，將於本月18日晚做最後一場。旅發局表示當晚將會加插煙火元素。<br/>\n<br/>\n同一晚歷來最大規模的「香港繽紛冬日巡禮」就會揭幕，今年「冬日小鎮」活動，會擴展至中環、尖沙咀及銅鑼灣。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.702289+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T11:37:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T20:00:09.516355+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:51.766633+00:00","content_hash":"88cf511b0301dadc8b880b0bc855271a7fc6d09bc21066b521ff14684d000439","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}